WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.149 --> 00:00:06.670
. After quite literally years of pushing for
this, the issue of Donald Trump's taxes has

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:09.020
made it to the Supreme Court.

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:15.599
And the Supreme Court yesterday has cleared
the way for Donald Trump's taxes to be released.

00:00:15.599 --> 00:00:23.589
Very important detail to be released to New
York prosecutors, not to the public or to

00:00:23.589 --> 00:00:25.419
the House of Representatives.

00:00:25.419 --> 00:00:30.550
You might remember that Donald Trump said
during the 2016 campaign that he would release

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:34.770
his taxes as soon as all of his audits were
over now.

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:39.200
In fact, it's been twenty two hundred days
almost since Donald Trump said he'd release

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:40.580
his tax returns.

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:43.280
He first said it in February of 2015.

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:46.670
He is not under if it's even true that he's
under audit.

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:52.910
Still, it wouldn't be for all of his years
of taxes, even if you believe that he shouldn't

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:57.010
release his tax returns while they are being
audited, which is a question he could release

00:00:57.010 --> 00:00:59.050
the ones that are not being audited.

00:00:59.050 --> 00:01:04.670
We don't know if there were any audits, but
it was all a lie in the sense that Donald

00:01:04.670 --> 00:01:10.510
Trump never had any intention of releasing
his tax returns because he clearly calculated

00:01:10.510 --> 00:01:15.160
he made the decision that whatever damage
would be done by not releasing them would

00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:19.280
be vastly outweighed by the damage if he did
release them.

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:27.000
Well, now, after numerous appeals and legal
arguments, the Supreme Court says that indeed

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:31.600
the records might be shielded from public
disclosure.

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:38.000
But it is time for a Manhattan district attorney,
Cyrus Vance, to get those Trump tax returns

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:43.979
for the purposes of his investigations into
hush money payments made by Donald Trump and

00:01:43.979 --> 00:01:45.820
other possible financial fraud.

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:52.030
So this finally is a step closer to prosecutors
getting the documents.

00:01:52.030 --> 00:01:55.950
It may or may not be a step closer to these
documents being made public.

00:01:55.950 --> 00:02:02.230
Now, we all know any time documents change
hands, the possibility of a leak becomes a

00:02:02.230 --> 00:02:03.230
reality.

00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:07.640
How likely these would be to leak from the
Manhattan D.A. when it would be known that

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:09.550
that's who had them?

00:02:09.550 --> 00:02:11.120
That remains to be seen.

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:12.420
But it's happening.

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:19.370
There are no more appeals to make, as was
reported by NBC's Pete Williams on MSNBC yesterday,

00:02:19.370 --> 00:02:25.519
quote, The New York grand jury will see Trump's
tax returns almost immediately.

00:02:25.519 --> 00:02:29.000
This is the end of the road for the president.

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:31.169
So a few different things here.

00:02:31.169 --> 00:02:38.959
It's absurd that it even took this long and
Trump kept appealing on different grounds.

00:02:38.959 --> 00:02:42.829
And when a court would decide against him,
he would immediately appeal.

00:02:42.829 --> 00:02:45.099
Again, it's gotten to the Supreme Court.

00:02:45.099 --> 00:02:46.390
It took a long time.

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:48.269
Trump's not even in here.

00:02:48.269 --> 00:02:52.129
He's been talking about releasing his tax
returns since before being in office.

00:02:52.129 --> 00:02:53.569
He's now gone.

00:02:53.569 --> 00:02:56.180
And this is only finally moving forward.

00:02:56.180 --> 00:03:00.379
Now, whether we ever see the taxes at this
point, I don't know.

00:03:00.379 --> 00:03:01.920
And it's less relevant.

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:08.930
It's more about whether Donald Trump can actually
get away with hiding his taxes forever and

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:10.209
from everyone.

00:03:10.209 --> 00:03:15.730
And it seems that at least the from everyone
is becoming a hard no as prosecutors are going

00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:16.730
to get them in.

00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:18.140
The grand jury is going to look at them.

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:23.980
Now, as I've said before, Donald Trump's legal
expenses for the foreseeable future are going

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:30.499
to be formidable if he pays his lawyers, which
is always a caveat with Donald Trump.

00:03:30.499 --> 00:03:36.650
And meanwhile, just as a reminder, there are
still conspiracy theorists, mostly of the

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:42.129
kuhnen persuasion, who believe that we are
just days from Donald Trump getting back in

00:03:42.129 --> 00:03:43.129
office.

00:03:43.129 --> 00:03:46.439
March 4th is the new date that many of them
have set.

00:03:46.439 --> 00:03:52.200
They believe, as we've talked about a week
or two ago, that due to a technicality relating

