00:03:58.370 --> 00:04:03.549
that somehow Donald Trump is going to go back
to power and back to being president on March

00:04:03.549 --> 00:04:04.620
4th.

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:11.239
This decision by the Supreme Court for the
very conspiratorial types is an attempt at

00:04:11.239 --> 00:04:14.819
interfering with Trump getting back in power
on March 4th.

00:04:14.819 --> 00:04:17.699
How it has anything to do with it, I don't
know.

00:04:17.699 --> 00:04:21.449
Obviously, Trump was never going to get back
in power on March 4th.

00:04:21.449 --> 00:04:28.190
But when it doesn't happen on March 4th, many
of these Kuhnen types will say it was because

00:04:28.190 --> 00:04:31.870
of this Supreme Court decision meant to.

