I don't even know, but it's apparently a big
factor in what's going on, so we'll wait and

00:04:37.479 --> 00:04:42.940
see on all of this stuff, including if and
when the tax returns ever become public.

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:46.520
The decision did cause Donald Trump to explode.

